WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.008 --> 00:00:16.995
Clop! Clop!

2
00:00:16.996 --> 00:00:19.166
Thump! Thump!

3
00:00:19.167 --> 00:00:22.949
The box bumped up and down.

4
00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:33.387
"Where are we going?" Mittens whispered.

5
00:00:33.388 --> 00:00:47.375
"I don't know," Tom whispered back.

6
00:00:47.376 --> 00:00:52.431
At last the box stopped.

7
00:00:52.432 --> 00:00:59.387
The kittens peeked out.

8
00:00:59.388 --> 00:01:03.657
"We are in town!" Tom said.

9
00:01:03.658 --> 00:01:09.866
He jumped out of the box.

10
00:01:09.867 --> 00:01:13.881
Tom ran down the road.

11
00:01:13.882 --> 00:01:17.730
His sisters ran after him.

12
00:01:17.731 --> 00:01:21.843
The town was very busy.

13
00:01:21.844 --> 00:01:29.100
People rushed past the kittens.

14
00:01:29.101 --> 00:01:34.270
Wagons and carts drove by.

15
00:01:34.271 --> 00:01:37.374
The town was noisy too.

16
00:01:37.375 --> 00:01:44.003
Bells rang and people laughed.

17
00:01:44.004 --> 00:01:47.560
Dogs barked and doors banged.

18
00:01:47.561 --> 00:01:56.417
"I'm scared," Mittens whispered.

19
00:01:56.418 --> 00:02:01.868
The kittens ran under a bench.

20
00:02:01.869 --> 00:02:05.308
"It's quiet here," Moppet said.

21
00:02:05.309 --> 00:02:07.730
"Let's rest."

22
00:02:07.731 --> 00:02:11.105
"I like this town," Tom said.

23
00:02:11.106 --> 00:02:13.762
"But it's too busy and noisy."

24
00:02:13.763 --> 00:02:16.379
Mittens nodded.

25
00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:20.883
"I want to go home," she said.

26
00:02:20.884 --> 00:02:23.740
The kittens looked one way.

27
00:02:23.741 --> 00:02:26.546
Then they looked another way.

28
00:02:26.547 --> 00:02:30.838
But all the roads looked the same.

29
00:02:30.839 --> 00:02:35.232
Mittens started to cry.

30
00:02:35.233 --> 00:02:38.539
"This is terrible!" she said.

31
00:02:38.540 --> 00:02:44.511
"We are lost!"
